Sigma rules
-----------
ZAAFElegia executes Sigma rules but does not bundle the SigmaHQ rule corpus.
Rules from https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma are licensed under the Detection
Rule License (DRL) 1.1. When you run them, DRL 1.1 requires that the rule
author and references remain visible; ZAAFElegia includes both in every alert in the
`json` and `ndjson` outputs (`unmapped.sigma.author` and `unmapped.sigma.references`)
and in the `csv` output (`author` and `references` columns). The `table` output shows
the author only; use `-o json`, `ndjson` or `csv` for references.
The Sigma specification and logo are public domain.

